{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://example.invalid/localai-scout/schemas/feasibility.schema.json",
  "title": "LocalAI Scout — feasibility.json",
  "description": "Saída de `scout plan --json` e de POST /plan. Autocontida: embute o system usado, a intenção, as constantes de tuning e o recorte do catálogo de cada modelo citado, para que o frontend (modo ARQUIVO) só RENDERIZE, sem aritmética. Determinística: sem timestamps nem nada que varie entre duas execuções sobre a mesma entrada. Bytes e tokens são inteiros; tokens/s e segundos são number (estimativas).",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["schema_version", "kind", "scout_version", "inputs", "pools", "candidates", "rejected", "excluded", "warnings"],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "allOf": [
    {"$comment": "Tudo ou nada (decode_range_spec.md §3): o tokens/s do início só existe junto da sua suposição. Arquivo sem inputs.decode.start_position_tokens (scout <= 0.2.0) continua válido e não pode ter o campo em candidato nenhum.",
     "if": {"properties": {"inputs": {"properties": {"decode": {"required": ["start_position_tokens"]}}}}},
     "then": {"properties": {"candidates": {"items": {"required": ["tokens_per_s_est_start"]}}}},
     "else": {"properties": {"candidates": {"items": {"not": {"required": ["tokens_per_s_est_start"]}}}}}}
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {"const": 1},
    "kind": {"const": "feasibility"},
    "scout_version": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+"},
    "fixture": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["synthetic", "description"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {"synthetic": {"const": true}, "description": {"type": "string"}}
    },
    "inputs": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["intent", "system", "catalog", "tuning", "calibration", "decode"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "allOf": [
        {"if": {"properties": {"calibration": {"properties": {"status": {"enum": ["used", "discarded"]}}}}, "required": ["calibration"]},
         "then": {"required": ["power"]}, "else": {"not": {"required": ["power"]}}}
      ],
      "properties": {
        "power": {"$ref": "calibration.schema.json#/$defs/power", "description": "Estado de energia ATUAL lido pela CLI; presente quando inputs.calibration.status é used ou discarded (calibration_store_spec.md §5)."},
        "calibration": {"$ref": "calibration.schema.json#/$defs/echo", "description": "Calibração local: origem, status, casamento campo a campo e entrada escolhida por pool. Nunca o caminho do arquivo."},
        "intent": {"$ref": "#/$defs/intent"},
        "decode": {"type": "object", "description": "Suposição de posição do tokens/s previsto (PROMPT.md, Throughput): resposta de answer_tokens terminando no fim da janela de window_tokens (= intent.ctx); o KV é lido na posição média position_tokens = window − answer/2 (window < answer: window/2, para cima). Vale para todo tokens_per_s_est. start_position_tokens (opcional; schemas/decode_range_spec.md): posição média do tokens_per_s_est_start, resposta de min(answer, window) tokens começando com o contexto vazio = ceil(min(answer, window)/2); sempre <= position_tokens. Presente se e só se todo candidato tem tokens_per_s_est_start (ver allOf da raiz); ausente em arquivos de scout <= 0.2.0.",
          "required": ["window_tokens", "answer_tokens", "position_tokens"], "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {"window_tokens": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}, "answer_tokens": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1},
            "position_tokens": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}, "start_position_tokens": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}}},
        "system": {"$ref": "system.schema.json"},
        "catalog": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["sha256", "model_count", "oldest_verified_at"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Identifica o catálogo usado. sha256 dos bytes exatos do arquivo lido.",
          "properties": {
            "sha256": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"},
            "model_count": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
            "oldest_verified_at": {"type": ["string", "null"], "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}
          }
        },
        "tuning": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": ["eta_gpu", "eta_cpu", "source"],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "eta_gpu": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0.3, "maximum": 1.0},
            "eta_cpu": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0.3, "maximum": 1.0},
            "source": {"enum": ["default", "calibrated"], "description": "calibrated = ajustado por `scout bench --run` nesta máquina."},
            "max_bpw_offload": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "description": "Acima deste bpw o placement hybrid não é avaliado (m7_fixes.md Fa)."},
            "prefill_reference": {"type": "object", "description": "Medição real de prefill em CPU usada no aviso slow_prefill_cpu. Nunca estimativa.",
              "required": ["tokens_per_s", "measured_on", "tool", "date"], "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {"tokens_per_s": {"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0}, "measured_on": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
                "tool": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$"}, "power": {"type": "string"}}}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "pools": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "description": "Orçamentos. gpu+cpu, ou só cpu, ou só unified.",
      "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pool"}
    },
    "candidates": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Já ordenados por (tier, tokens_per_s desc). Nunca contém tier inviavel. Ordem é a do solver; o frontend não reordena por conta própria.",
      "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/candidate"}
    },
    "rejected": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rejected"}},
    "excluded": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Pulados em silêncio pelo algoritmo (sem motivo por item). Só contagens, para transparência.",
      "required": ["incomplete", "task_mismatch"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "incomplete": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "task_mismatch": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}
      }
    },
    "warnings": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/warning"}}
  },
  "$defs": {
    "task": {"enum": ["chat", "code", "embeddings", "vlm", "stt", "diffusion"]},
    "tier": {"enum": ["confortavel", "limite", "inviavel"]},
    "confidence": {"enum": ["high", "medium", "low"]},
    "placement": {"enum": ["gpu_full", "hybrid", "cpu_only"]},
    "pool_id": {"enum": ["gpu", "cpu", "unified"]},
    "provenance_value": {
      "enum": ["catalog", "measured", "calculated", "estimated"],
      "description": "catalog = copiado do catálogo; measured = detectado no hardware ou medido por bench; calculated = fórmula determinística da spec sobre entradas catalog/measured de confiança high/medium; estimated = depende de constante empírica (eta, k_ovh, tabela de bpw/banda) ou de entrada com confidence low. Regra: proveniência de um derivado = a pior entre as entradas."
    },
    "provenance": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Mapa nome-do-campo-numérico -> proveniência. Todo número exibível do objeto tem entrada aqui.",
      "additionalProperties": {"$ref": "#/$defs/provenance_value"}
    },
    "calibration": {"$ref": "calibration.schema.json#/$defs/pool_calibration"},
    "intent": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["tasks", "ctx", "commercial_use", "batch", "kv_quant"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "prompt_tokens": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "description": "Tamanho do prompt; só usado para ttft com prefill calibrado."},
        "tasks": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/task"}},
        "ctx": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "description": "tokens"},
        "commercial_use": {"type": "boolean"},
        "batch": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1},
        "kv_quant": {"enum": ["f16", "q8_0", "q4_0"]}
      }
    },
    "pool": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["id", "gpu_index", "total_bytes", "reserved_bytes", "usable_bytes", "bandwidth_bytes_per_s", "eta", "provenance"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pool_id"},
        "gpu_index": {"type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 0, "description": "Índice em system.gpus.value; null para cpu/unified."},
        "total_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "reserved_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "description": "gpu: vram_display + 600_000_000; cpu: 3_000_000_000."},
        "usable_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "description": "Orçamento. Truncado em 0 com aviso se a fórmula der negativo."},
        "bandwidth_bytes_per_s": {"type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1},
        "eta": {"type": "number", "minimum": 0.3, "maximum": 1.0},
        "provenance": {"$ref": "#/$defs/provenance"}
      }
    },
    "pool_usage": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["pool", "weights_bytes", "kv_bytes", "buffer_bytes", "total_bytes", "budget_bytes", "tier"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "pool": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pool_id"},
        "weights_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "kv_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "buffer_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "total_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "budget_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "tier": {"$ref": "#/$defs/tier"}
      }
    },
    "model_ref": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Recorte do catálogo necessário para exibir o modelo sem o catálogo inteiro.",
      "required": ["id", "source_url", "license", "license_source", "commercial_ok", "tasks", "params_total", "params_active", "n_layers"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 3},
        "source_url": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^https://"},
        "license": {"type": ["string", "null"]},
        "license_source": {"type": ["string", "null"], "pattern": "^https://"},
        "commercial_ok": {"type": ["boolean", "null"]},
        "tasks": {"type": ["array", "null"], "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/task"}},
        "params_total": {"type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1},
        "params_active": {"type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1},
        "n_layers": {"type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1}
      }
    },
    "quant_ref": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["format", "name", "bpw", "file_bytes"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "format": {"enum": ["GGUF", "EXL2", "AWQ", "GPTQ"]},
        "name": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "bpw": {"type": ["number", "null"], "exclusiveMinimum": 0},
        "file_bytes": {"type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1, "description": "Tamanho do download."}
      }
    },
    "skipped_quant": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["format", "name", "reason_code"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "format": {"enum": ["GGUF", "EXL2", "AWQ", "GPTQ"]},
        "name": {"type": "string"},
        "reason_code": {"enum": ["below_quality_floor", "bpw_unknown", "does_not_fit", "format_requires_full_gpu", "no_gpu_for_format", "bpw_above_offload_limit"]}
      }
    },
    "candidate": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["model", "quant", "placement", "n_gpu_layers", "n_threads", "weights_bytes", "kv_bytes", "buffer_bytes", "total_bytes", "by_pool", "tier", "tokens_per_s_est", "ttft_s_est", "confidence", "confidence_reasons", "blocked", "blocked_reason", "primary_for", "skipped_quants", "provenance"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "model": {"$ref": "#/$defs/model_ref"},
        "quant": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quant_ref"},
        "placement": {"$ref": "#/$defs/placement"},
        "n_gpu_layers": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "description": "gpu_full = n_layers; cpu_only = 0; hybrid = 1..n_layers-1."},
        "n_threads": {"type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1, "description": "De cpu.cores_performance; nunca de núcleos lógicos."},
        "weights_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1},
        "kv_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "buffer_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "total_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "description": "weights + kv + buffer (soma de todos os pools)."},
        "by_pool": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "maxItems": 2, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pool_usage"}},
        "tier": {"enum": ["confortavel", "limite"], "description": "Pior tier entre by_pool. inviavel nunca é candidato."},
        "tokens_per_s_est": {"type": ["number", "null"], "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "description": "null se faltar banda do pool. Previsto no FIM da janela (inputs.decode.position_tokens); é o único tokens/s que ordena candidatos e decide recomendação."},
        "tokens_per_s_est_start": {"type": ["number", "null"], "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "description": "Opcional por arquivo, obrigatório por candidato quando inputs.decode.start_position_tokens existe (allOf da raiz). Mesmo placement, mesmos trechos, calibração e eta de tokens_per_s_est; só a posição do KV lido muda (inputs.decode.start_position_tokens). null se e só se tokens_per_s_est é null. Sempre >= tokens_per_s_est (verificado em teste, não expressável aqui). Nunca ordena, nunca decide (schemas/decode_range_spec.md)."},
        "notes": {"type": "array", "description": "Opcional (m7_fixes.md R3). Decisões do solver que afetaram este candidato sem gerar rejeição; ordem = ordem de avaliação das quants.",
          "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["code", "message"], "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {"code": {"enum": ["offload_skipped_above_bpw", "decode_not_applicable"]}, "message": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}}}},
        "tokens_per_s_basis": {"enum": ["calibration", "eta", "mixed"], "description": "calibration = todos os trechos com camadas usam a entrada aplicada de inputs.calibration; eta = nenhum; mixed = híbrido com um trecho de cada."},
        "ctx_effective": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "description": "Só em modelos avaliados apenas para embeddings: min(intent.ctx, ctx_max), o contexto usado no KV e no buffer (DECISIONS.md)."},
        "ttft_s_est": {"type": ["number", "null"], "exclusiveMinimum": 0, "description": "null enquanto a fórmula de prefill não for especificada (DECISIONS.md)."},
        "confidence": {"$ref": "#/$defs/confidence"},
        "confidence_reasons": {"type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"enum": ["weights_fallback", "bpw_from_table", "bandwidth_estimated", "bandwidth_unknown", "hardware_low_confidence", "eta_default", "ttft_unspecified", "ranked_by_bytes", "decode_not_applicable", "calibration_unstable", "calibration_other_arch", "calibration_power_mismatch", "calibration_power_unknown", "calibration_memory_unverified", "calibration_engine_changed", "calibration_engine_unknown", "calibration_kernel_changed", "calibration_kernel_unknown"]}},
        "blocked": {"type": "boolean"},
        "blocked_reason": {"enum": ["non_commercial", "license_unknown", null]},
        "primary_for": {"type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/task"}, "description": "Tarefas para as quais este é a recomendação principal, decidido pelo solver. Candidato blocked tem sempre []."},
        "skipped_quants": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/skipped_quant"}, "description": "Quants de bpw maior tentadas antes desta e por que falharam."},
        "provenance": {"$ref": "#/$defs/provenance"}
      },
      "allOf": [
        {"if": {"properties": {"blocked": {"const": true}}}, "then": {"properties": {"blocked_reason": {"type": "string"}, "primary_for": {"maxItems": 0}}}, "else": {"properties": {"blocked_reason": {"const": null}}}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"placement": {"const": "cpu_only"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"n_gpu_layers": {"const": 0}}}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"placement": {"const": "hybrid"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"n_gpu_layers": {"minimum": 1}, "quant": {"properties": {"format": {"const": "GGUF"}}}, "by_pool": {"minItems": 2}}}},
        {"if": {"properties": {"tokens_per_s_est": {"type": "null"}}}, "then": {"properties": {"tokens_per_s_est_start": {"type": "null"}}}, "else": {"properties": {"tokens_per_s_est_start": {"type": "number"}}}},
        {"if": {"required": ["tokens_per_s_est_start"]}, "then": {"properties": {"provenance": {"required": ["tokens_per_s_est_start"]}}}}
      ]
    },
    "rejected": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["model", "reason_code", "message", "closest", "missing_bytes", "skipped_quants"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "model": {"$ref": "#/$defs/model_ref"},
        "reason_code": {"enum": ["ctx_exceeds_max", "kv_model_unsupported", "below_quality_floor", "no_usable_quant", "does_not_fit", "format_requires_full_gpu", "no_gpu_for_format"]},
        "message": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "description": "Texto pt-BR gerado por template no solver, nunca por LLM."},
        "closest": {
          "description": "Tentativa (quant, placement) de menor déficit; null quando a rejeição é anterior ao cálculo (ctx, mla).",
          "oneOf": [
            {"type": "null"},
            {"type": "object", "required": ["quant", "placement", "total_bytes", "by_pool"], "additionalProperties": false,
             "properties": {"quant": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quant_ref"}, "placement": {"$ref": "#/$defs/placement"}, "total_bytes": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1}, "by_pool": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pool_usage"}}}}
          ]
        },
        "missing_bytes": {"type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1, "description": "Bytes que faltam para a tentativa 'closest' chegar ao tier limite: max sobre os pools de (total_bytes - floor(0.95*budget_bytes)). null se não houve cálculo."},
        "skipped_quants": {"type": "array", "items": {"$ref": "#/$defs/skipped_quant"}},
        "provenance": {"$ref": "#/$defs/provenance", "description": "Opcional (F7). missing_bytes: estimated se a tentativa mais próxima usou pesos por fallback, senão calculated. Ausente => calculated."}
      },
      "allOf": [
        {"if": {"properties": {"reason_code": {"enum": ["does_not_fit", "format_requires_full_gpu"]}}}, "then": {"properties": {"missing_bytes": {"type": "integer"}, "closest": {"type": "object"}}}}
      ]
    },
    "warning": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["code", "severity", "message"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "code": {"enum": ["on_battery", "hdd_storage", "swap_not_a_fix", "multi_gpu_ignored", "hardware_field_missing", "bandwidth_estimated", "vram_usable_clamped", "catalog_stale", "unified_memory_single_pool", "quality_preference", "slow_prefill_cpu", "calibration_power_mismatch", "calibration_power_unknown", "calibration_machine_mismatch", "calibration_machine_unknown", "calibration_schema_outdated", "calibration_engine_changed", "calibration_engine_unknown", "calibration_kernel_changed", "calibration_kernel_unknown", "calibration_memory_unverified"]},
        "severity": {"enum": ["info", "warn"]},
        "message": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "field": {"type": "string", "description": "Caminho JSON do campo relacionado, ex. 'memory.speed_mts'."}
      }
    }
  }
}
